{20}{I am responsible for the running and operation of the finest city in Arcanum - Latveria.  It is a jewel in the crown of the land.  I am glad you have journeyed this far to visit us, sir.}{I am responsible for the running and operation of the finest city in Arcanum - Latveria.  It is a jewel in the crown of the land.  I am glad you have journeyed this far to visit us, ma'am.}{}{}{}{}
