{40}{The problem is actually two-fold.  One is a group of 'Technology Rebels' seeking to undermine my authority.  The second is a vicious group of mages calling themselves the 'Inner Circle'.}{The problem is actually two-fold.  One is a group of 'technology rebels' seeking to undermine my authority.  The second is a vicious group of mages calling themselves the 'Inner Circle'.}{}{}{}{}
